SUMMARY:Marty Supreme
DTSTART:20260122T234000Z
DTEND:20260123T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20260122T234000Z
UID:iqvX0KyUQ7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 149 mins (2h29m)\n\nMarty Mauser\, a young man with 
 a dream no one respects\, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness. 
 From writer/director Josh Safdie and starring Timothée Chalamet\, Gwyneth
  Paltrow\, Odessa A'zion\, Kevin O'Leary\, Tyler Okonma\, Abel Ferrara\, a
 nd Fran Drescher. Three Golden Globe nominations including Best Motion Pi
 cture - Musical or Comedy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/mart
 y-supreme\n\nEstimated start: 15:55
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
