BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gaza is Our Home
DTSTART:20260123T023000Z
DTEND:20260123T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260123T023000Z
UID:1LwysAaFiy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nPresented by Peyvand Nonprofit 
 Gaza Is Our Home is a profoundly personal documentary that peels back the
  layers of devastation within the Gaza Strip\, as witnessed through the le
 ns of filmmaker Monear Shaer. His debut documentary was created out of ago
 ny as a timely\, impactful\, and tragic response to the collective anguish
  of all who call Gaza home...\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/g
 aza-is-our-home-(documentary)\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Resurrection
DTSTART:20260123T231500Z
DTEND:20260124T022000Z
DTSTAMP:20260123T231500Z
UID:6yNgjxZIAP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 170 mins (2h50m)\n\nThis phantasmagoric dream machin
 e from visionary Chinese director Bi Gan (Long Day’s Journey Into Night)
  is an elusive yet monumental love letter to a century of cinema\, unfoldi
 ng over five chapters that feature a dazzling array of styles and genres.\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/resurrection\n\nEstimated start
 : 15:30
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
