 b\, Cascade Bicycle Studio\,and Noir Rouge Productions We Ride Why is a d
 ocumentary film about the power of love\, community\, and hope in the face
  of cancer. The film follows the stories of several women who have been im
 pacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and family who support them. Thr
